    "author_association": "NONE",
    "body": "https://github.com/TokTok/c-toxcore/blob/7c3be23429b004d8df00aec309ed9d5be1b25dcf/toxencryptsave/toxencryptsave.c#L173\n\nThis is more a question not an issue, i am (again) new to github and dont know how to ask somewhere else.\n\nThe salt anyhow is stored inside the output together with the retrieved private key.  The intermediary value inside passkey can be computed from the cleartext passphrase and the salt. So why to wipe it? And if so, why the passphrase is not wiped? Because the user may still need it during processing?\n\nThanks",
